STXR1 "MARKOBSERVED|MOBS MO||0|1|it had no effect; a measured qubit is simply measured|ez zuen eraginik; neurtutako qubit bat neurtuta dago, besterik ez|MARKOBSERVED|MARKOBSERVED|"
STXR1 "RELEASE|REL RL||0|1|it had no effect; a simulator has nothing to release|ez zuen eraginik; simulagailu batek ez du ezer askatzeko|RELEASE|RELEASE|"
STXR1 "DECOHERENCEPROTECT|DPROT DP||0|1|there is no physical model behind it; study decoherence with `qoa run --noise`|ez dago eredu fisikorik atzean; dekoherentzia aztertzeko erabili `qoa run --noise`|DECOHERENCEPROTECT|DECOHERENCEPROTECT|"
STXR1 "ENTANGLESWAPMEASURE|ESWAPM ESM||0|1|use ESWAP, then branch on the measured bits with JUMPIFONE|erabili ESWAP, eta gero adarkatu neurtutako bitekin JUMPIFONE bidez|ENTANGLESWAPMEASURE|ENTANGLESWAPMEASURE|"
STXR1 "ENTANGLEWITHCLASSICALFEEDBACK|EWCFB ECFB||0|1|use gates plus JUMPIFONE/IFEQ for classical feedback|erabili ateak eta JUMPIFONE/IFEQ atzeraelikadura klasikorako|ENTANGLEWITHCLASSICALFEEDBACK|ENTANGLEWITHCLASSICALFEEDBACK|"
STXR1 "ENTANGLEDISTRIBUTED|EDIST ED||0|1|networked entanglement between machines is not modelled|makinen arteko sareko entrelazamendua ez dago modelatuta|ENTANGLEDISTRIBUTED|ENTANGLEDISTRIBUTED|"
STXR1 "APPLYNONLINEARPHASESHIFT|ANLPS ANLP ANLPH||0|1|it was never defined; use KERR or CROSSKERR|ez zen inoiz definitu; erabili KERR edo CROSSKERR|APPLYNONLINEARPHASESHIFT|APPLYNONLINEARPHASESHIFT|"
STXR1 "APPLYNONLINEARSIGMA|ANLS ANLSI||0|1|it was never defined; use KERR or CROSSKERR|ez zen inoiz definitu; erabili KERR edo CROSSKERR|APPLYNONLINEARSIGMA|APPLYNONLINEARSIGMA|"
STXR1 "QUANTUMZENOEFFECT|QZE QZEN||0|1|it needs continuous-time evolution, which QOA does not model; repeated MEASURE in a LOOPSTART shows the freezing|denbora jarraituko bilakaera behar du, eta QOA-k ez du modelatzen; LOOPSTART baten barruko MEASURE errepikatuek izozte bera erakusten dute|QUANTUMZENOEFFECT|QUANTUMZENOEFFECT|"
STXR1 "APPLYLINEAROPTICALTRANSFORM|ALOT ALOPT||0|1|build the network from BS and MODEPHASE; every linear optical unitary decomposes into them|eraiki sarea BS eta MODEPHASE erabiliz; unitario optiko lineal oro haietan deskonposatzen da|APPLYLINEAROPTICALTRANSFORM|APPLYLINEAROPTICALTRANSFORM|"
STXR1 "ERRORCORRECT|ECORR EC||0|1|no error-correcting code was ever specified; write the correction circuit with gates|ez zen inoiz errore-zuzentzeko koderik zehaztu; idatzi zuzenketa-zirkuitua ateekin|ERRORCORRECT|ERRORCORRECT|"
STXR1 "ERRORSYNDROME|ESYN ES||0|1|no code was ever specified; write the syndrome circuit with gates and MEASURE|ez zen inoiz koderik zehaztu; idatzi sindrome-zirkuitua ateekin eta MEASURE-rekin|ERRORSYNDROME|ERRORSYNDROME|"
STXR1 "PHOTONROUTE|PROUTE PR||0|1|ports were never defined; use MODESWAP or BS|atakak ez ziren inoiz definitu; erabili MODESWAP edo BS|PHOTONROUTE|PHOTONROUTE|"
STXR1 "TIMEDELAY|TDELAY TD||0|1|an ideal delay changes nothing; model a real one with LOSS and MODEPHASE|atzerapen ideal batek ez du ezer aldatzen; benetakoa modelatzeko erabili LOSS eta MODEPHASE|TIMEDELAY|TIMEDELAY|"
STXR1 "OPTICALDELAYLINECONTROL|ODLC ODL||0|1|an ideal delay changes nothing; model a real one with LOSS and MODEPHASE|atzerapen ideal batek ez du ezer aldatzen; benetakoa modelatzeko erabili LOSS eta MODEPHASE|OPTICALDELAYLINECONTROL|OPTICALDELAYLINECONTROL|"
STXR1 "WAIT|||0|1|an ideal wait changes nothing; use `qoa run --noise` to study idle errors|itxaronaldi ideal batek ez du ezer aldatzen; geldirik dauden erroreak aztertzeko erabili `qoa run --noise`|WAIT|WAIT|"
STXR1 "PHOTONBUNCHINGCONTROL|PBUNCH PBC||0|1|bunching comes from interference (see BS), it is not a switch|multzokatzea interferentziatik dator (ikus BS), ez da etengailu bat|PHOTONBUNCHINGCONTROL|PHOTONBUNCHINGCONTROL|"
STXR1 "SINGLEPHOTONSOURCEOFF|SPSOFF||0|1|sources are instantaneous (SINGLEPHOTON); there is nothing to switch off|iturriak berehalakoak dira (SINGLEPHOTON); ez dago ezer itzaltzeko|SINGLEPHOTONSOURCEOFF|SINGLEPHOTONSOURCEOFF|"
STXR1 "APPLYDISPLACEMENTOPERATOR|ADO ADOP||0|1|use DISPLACE|erabili DISPLACE|APPLYDISPLACEMENTOPERATOR|APPLYDISPLACEMENTOPERATOR|"
STXR1 "OPTICALSWITCHCONTROL|OSC OSW||0|1|use MODESWAP to switch|erabili MODESWAP aldatzeko|OPTICALSWITCHCONTROL|OPTICALSWITCHCONTROL|"
STXR1 "MEASUREWITHDELAY|MWD MWDEL||0|1|an ideal delay changes nothing; use MEASURE|atzerapen ideal batek ez du ezer aldatzen; erabili MEASURE|MEASUREWITHDELAY|MEASUREWITHDELAY|"
STXR1 "PHOTONLOSSCORRECTION|PLC PLCOR||0|1|no loss-correcting code was ever specified|ez zen inoiz galera zuzentzeko koderik zehaztu|PHOTONLOSSCORRECTION|PHOTONLOSSCORRECTION|"
STXR1 "PHOTONEMISSIONPATTERN|PEPAT PEP||0|1|it was never defined; use EMIT inside LOOPSTART|ez zen inoiz definitu; erabili EMIT LOOPSTART baten barruan|PHOTONEMISSIONPATTERN|PHOTONEMISSIONPATTERN|"
STXR1 "APPLYFEEDFORWARDGATE|AFFG||0|1|use JUMPIFONE or IFEQ to apply gates conditionally|erabili JUMPIFONE edo IFEQ ateak baldintzapean aplikatzeko|APPLYFEEDFORWARDGATE|APPLYFEEDFORWARDGATE|"
STXR1 "THERMALAVG|||0|1|not a quantum-circuit operation|ez da zirkuitu kuantikoko eragiketa bat|THERMALAVG|THERMALAVG|"
STXR1 "WKBFACTOR|||0|1|not a quantum-circuit operation|ez da zirkuitu kuantikoko eragiketa bat|WKBFACTOR|WKBFACTOR|"
STXR1 "CMP|||0|1|IFEQ, IFNE, IFGT and IFLT compare registers directly|IFEQ, IFNE, IFGT eta IFLT aginduek erregistroak zuzenean konparatzen dituzte|CMP|CMP|"
STXR1 "JMPABS|JMPA JABS||0|1|byte addresses no longer exist; jump to a label|byte-helbideak jada ez daude; jauzi etiketa batera|JMPABS|JMPABS|"
STXR1 "CALLADDR|CADDR CA||0|1|byte addresses no longer exist; CALL a label|byte-helbideak jada ez daude; erabili CALL etiketa batekin|CALLADDR|CALLADDR|"
STXR1 "LOADMEM|LMEM LM||0|1|memory is now LOAD dst addr, with the address in a register|memoria orain LOAD helmuga helbidea da, helbidea erregistro batean|LOADMEM|LOADMEM|"
STXR1 "STOREMEM|SMEM SM||0|1|memory is now STORE src addr, with the address in a register|memoria orain STORE iturria helbidea da, helbidea erregistro batean|STOREMEM|STOREMEM|"
STXR1 "LOADCLASSICAL|LCL LC||0|1|memory is now LOAD dst addr, with the address in a register|memoria orain LOAD helmuga helbidea da, helbidea erregistro batean|LOADCLASSICAL|LOADCLASSICAL|"
STXR1 "STORECLASSICAL|SCL SC||0|1|memory is now STORE src addr, with the address in a register|memoria orain STORE iturria helbidea da, helbidea erregistro batean|STORECLASSICAL|STORECLASSICAL|"
STXR1 "ALLOC|ALC||0|1|memory needs no allocation: LOAD and STORE use cells 0, 1, 2, ... directly|memoriak ez du esleipenik behar: LOAD eta STORE 0, 1, 2, ... gelaxkak zuzenean erabiltzen dituzte|ALLOC|ALLOC|"
STXR1 "FREE|FRE||0|1|memory needs no freeing: LOAD and STORE use cells 0, 1, 2, ... directly|memoria ez da askatu behar: LOAD eta STORE 0, 1, 2, ... gelaxkak zuzenean erabiltzen dituzte|FREE|FREE|"
STXR1 "BREAKPOINT|BP||0|1|use DUMPSTATE and DUMPREGS to look at a point in the program|erabili DUMPSTATE eta DUMPREGS programaren puntu bat ikusteko|BREAKPOINT|BREAKPOINT|"
STXR1 "EXITCODE|EXC EX||0|1|use HALT|erabili HALT|EXITCODE|EXITCODE|"
STXR1 "QUBITS|QUBIT||0|1|use QINIT with the qubit count, e.g. QINIT 25|erabili QINIT qubit-kopuruarekin, adib. QINIT 25|QUBITS|QUBITS|"
STXR1 "QGATE|||0|1|use GATE name qubit, or the gate's own instruction|erabili GATE izena qubita, edo atearen agindu propioa|QGATE|QGATE|"
; @isa-end
STXR1 ""
STR1 R0
RCR0 R2
RET

; buildtext: agindu bakoitza zein eraikitzailek sortzen duen (eta haren parametroa), izen nagusiaren arabera.
; hau mihiztatzailearen logika da, ez src/isa.rs-eko datua: eraikitzaileak `build` atalean daude.
buildtext:
SETR0 0
LDR1 R0
RCR2 R1
STXR1 "H 1 0 X 1 1 Y 1 2 Z 1 3 S 1 4 SDG 1 5 T 1 6 TDG 1 7 SX 1 8 SXDG 1 9"
STXR1 "PHASE 2 13 RX 2 10 RY 2 11 RZ 2 12 U 3 0 ROT 4 0 MROT 5 0 GATE 6 0"
STXR1 "CNOT 7 1 CY 7 2 CH 7 0 CSX 7 8 CRX 8 10 CRY 8 11 CRZ 8 12 CU 9 0 CZ 10 0 CPHASE 10 1"
STXR1 "SWAP 11 0 CSWAP 12 0 CCX 13 0 MCX 14 0 MCZ 15 0 BELL 16 0 GHZ 17 5 CLUSTER 17 6 ESWAP 18 0"
STXR1 "MEASURE 19 0 MEASUREIN 20 0 MEASUREALL 21 9 RESETALL 21 11 DUMPSTATE 21 32 DUMPREGS 21 33"
STXR1 "RETSUB 21 52 HALT 21 55 BARRIER 21 56"
STXR1 "RESET 22 10 ADDPHOTON 22 27 SUBPHOTON 22 28 RAND 22 41 INPUT 22 43 GETTIME 22 44 PUSH 60 0"
STXR1 "POP 22 46 CHAROUT 61 0 GETC 22 64 PUTC 62 0 GETLANG 22 68 ARGC 22 69"
STXR1 "EMIT 23 13 DISPLACEREG 23 19 SQUEEZEREG 23 21 REGCOPY 57 0 LOAD 58 0 STORE 59 0 ARGBYTE 63 0"
STXR1 "TOBASIS 25 0 DISPLACE 26 18 SQUEEZE 26 20 MODEPHASE 27 0 KERR 28 0 CROSSKERR 29 0 BS 29 1"
STXR1 "MODESWAP 29 2 LOSS 30 0 FOCK 31 0 SINGLEPHOTON 32 0 COUNT 33 0 DETECT 34 15 PARITY 34 16"
STXR1 "COINCIDENCE 35 0 DISPERSIVE 36 0 EXPECT 37 0 BELLCHECK 38 0 MEANPHOTON 39 0 REGSET 40 0"
STXR1 "ADD 41 0 SUB 41 1 MUL 41 2 DIV 41 3 ANDBITS 41 4 ORBITS 41 5 XORBITS 41 6 SHL 41 7 SHR 41 8"
STXR1 "POW 41 9 SQRT 42 0 EXP 42 1 LOG 42 2 NOTBITS 42 3 SIN 42 4 COS 42 5 TAN 42 6 SEEDRNG 43 0"
STXR1 "CHARLOAD 44 0 PACKBITS 45 0 JUMP 46 48 CALL 46 51 JUMPIFZERO 47 0 JUMPIFONE 47 1"
STXR1 "IFEQ 48 0 IFNE 48 1 IFGT 48 2 IFLT 48 3 LOOPSTART 49 0 LOOPEND 50 0 PRINT 51 0 PRINTLN 51 1"
STXR1 "PRINTF 52 0 VERBOSELOG 53 0 STORETEXT 54 0 STREAM 55 0 EXIT 56 0"
STXR1 "QINIT 99 1 QMODE 99 2 QREG 99 3 CREG 99 4 OREG 99 5 COMMENT 99 6 RREG 99 7 CONST 99 8"
STXR1 ""
STR1 R0
RCR0 R2
RET

; field: R0 = testuaren kurtsorea (byteak, 0-z amaitua) -> R0 = eremuaren hasiera, R1 = luzera, R2 = hurrengo
; eremuaren kurtsorea ('|' ondoren, edo 0-an geratzen da). aldatzen ditu R0-R4
field:
RCR2 R0
SETR4 124
field.next:
LDR3 R2
IEQR3 R30 field.end
IEQR3 R4 field.bar
ADDR2 R2 R31
J field.next
field.bar:
SUBR1 R2 R0
ADDR2 R2 R31
RET
field.end:
SUBR1 R2 R0
RET

; isaload: taula irakurri eta izen-taula bete; gero eraikitzaileak lotu
isaload:
PUSHR8
PUSHR9
PUSHR10
PUSHR11
PUSHR12
PUSHR13
PUSHR14
; zehaztapenak: gehienez 512
SETR0 12288
C alloc
SETR1 8
STR0 R1
RCR10 R0
; izen-taula: 2048 zirrikitu
SETR0 2048
C alloc
SETR1 10
STR0 R1
SETR0 2047
SETR1 11
STR0 R1
C isatext
RCR8 R0
SETR9 0
isaload.rec:
LDR0 R8
IEQR0 R30 isaload.end
SETR0 24
MULR11 R9 R0
ADDR11 R10 R11
; 0 izena
RCR0 R8
C field
STR0 R11
ADDR3 R11 R31
STR1 R3
RCR12 R2
; 1 ezizenak: geroago (R13, R14 = testua)
RCR0 R12
C field
RCR13 R0
RCR14 R1
RCR12 R2
; 2 eragigaiak
RCR0 R12
C field
PUSHR2
RCR2 R11
C operands
POPR12
; 3 hedapena, 4 kendua
RCR0 R12
C field
LDR0 R0
SETR3 48
SUBR0 R0 R3
SETR3 4
ADDR3 R11 R3
STR0 R3
RCR12 R2
RCR0 R12
C field
LDR0 R0
SETR3 48
SUBR0 R0 R3
SETR3 5
ADDR3 R11 R3
STR0 R3
RCR12 R2
; 5..8: arrazoiak eta erabilerak, 6. gelaxkatik aurrera bikoteka
SETR5 6
ADDR5 R11 R5
LS 4
RCR0 R12
C field
STR0 R5
ADDR5 R5 R31
STR1 R5
ADDR5 R5 R31
RCR12 R2
LE
; 9 izen labur leuna (0.4.5): agindu-lekuan bakarrik, izen-taulan zehaztapena negatiboan
RCR0 R12
C field
PUSHR0
PUSHR1
RCR12 R2
; hurrengo erregistroa: 0aren ondoren
isaload.skip:
LDR0 R12
IEQR0 R30 isaload.next
ADDR12 R12 R31
J isaload.skip
isaload.next:
ADDR8 R12 R31
; izena eta ezizenak izen-taulan
LDR0 R11
ADDR1 R11 R31
LDR1 R1
RCR2 R11
C mnput
RCR0 R13
RCR1 R14
RCR2 R11
C aliases
POPR1
POPR0
IEQR1 R30 isaload.nosoft
SUBR2 R30 R11
C mnput
isaload.nosoft:
ADDR9 R9 R31
J isaload.rec
isaload.end:
SETR0 9
STR9 R0
C builders
POPR14
POPR13
POPR12
POPR11
POPR10
POPR9
POPR8
RET

; mnput: R0, R1 = izena, R2 = zehaztapena -> izen-taulan (izen bera berriz agertzen bada, azkenak irabazten du,
; rust-en HashMap::insert bezala). aldatzen ditu R0-R7
mnput:
PUSHR8
PUSHR9
PUSHR10
RCR8 R0
RCR9 R1
RCR10 R2
SETR0 10
LDR0 R0
RCR1 R8
RCR2 R9
SETR3 2047
C htfind
IEQR1 R30 mnput.new
ADDR1 R1 R31
ADDR1 R1 R31
STR10 R1
J mnput.done
mnput.new:
RCR4 R0
SETR0 3
PUSHR4
C alloc
POPR4
STR8 R0
ADDR1 R0 R31
STR9 R1
ADDR1 R1 R31
STR10 R1
STR0 R4
mnput.done:
POPR10
POPR9
POPR8
RET

; aliases: R0, R1 = hutsunez bereizitako ezizenak, R2 = zehaztapena -> zerrenda (16-17) eta izen-taula
aliases:
PUSHR8
PUSHR9
PUSHR10
PUSHR11
PUSHR12
RCR8 R0
ADDR9 R0 R1
RCR10 R2
; gehienez luzera/2 + 1 ezizen
RCR0 R1
ADDR0 R0 R31
C alloc
SETR1 16
ADDR1 R10 R1
STR0 R1
RCR11 R0
SETR12 0
aliases.next:
IEQR8 R9 aliases.done
LDR0 R8
SETR1 32
INER0 R1 aliases.word
ADDR8 R8 R31
J aliases.next
aliases.word:
RCR3 R8
aliases.scan:
IEQR8 R9 aliases.got
LDR0 R8
SETR1 32
IEQR0 R1 aliases.got
ADDR8 R8 R31
J aliases.scan
aliases.got:
SETR0 2
MULR0 R12 R0
ADDR0 R11 R0
STR3 R0
SUBR1 R8 R3
ADDR0 R0 R31
STR1 R0
ADDR12 R12 R31
RCR0 R3
RCR2 R10
C mnput
J aliases.next
aliases.done:
SETR1 17
ADDR1 R10 R1
STR12 R1
POPR12
POPR11
POPR10
POPR9
POPR8
RET

; operands: R0, R1 = "q:control q:target" bezalako testua, R2 = zehaztapena -> eragigai-zerrenda (2-3)
operands:
PUSHR8
PUSHR9
PUSHR10
PUSHR11
PUSHR12
RCR8 R0
ADDR9 R0 R1
RCR10 R2
SETR0 40
C alloc
SETR1 2
ADDR1 R10 R1
STR0 R1
RCR11 R0
SETR12 0
operands.next:
IEQR8 R9 operands.done
LDR0 R8
SETR1 32
INER0 R1 operands.item
ADDR8 R8 R31
J operands.next
operands.item:
; mota:izena[?+*]
SETR0 5
MULR0 R12 R0
ADDR7 R11 R0
LDR0 R8
STR0 R7
SETR0 2
ADDR8 R8 R0
RCR3 R8
operands.scan:
IEQR8 R9 operands.got
LDR0 R8
SETR1 32
IEQR0 R1 operands.got
ADDR8 R8 R31
J operands.scan
operands.got:
SUBR4 R8 R3
SUBR0 R8 R31
LDR0 R0
SETR5 0
SETR6 0
SETR1 63
INER0 R1 operands.plus
SETR5 1
SUBR4 R4 R31
J operands.set
operands.plus:
SETR1 43
INER0 R1 operands.star
SETR6 1
SUBR4 R4 R31
J operands.set
operands.star:
SETR1 42
INER0 R1 operands.set
SETR5 1
SETR6 2
SUBR4 R4 R31
operands.set:
ADDR0 R7 R31
STR3 R0
ADDR0 R0 R31
STR4 R0
ADDR0 R0 R31
STR5 R0
ADDR0 R0 R31
STR6 R0
ADDR12 R12 R31
J operands.next
operands.done:
SETR1 3
ADDR1 R10 R1
STR12 R1
POPR12
POPR11
POPR10
POPR9
POPR8
RET

; lookup: R0, R1 = mnemonikoa (kode-puntuak) -> R0 = zehaztapena, edo 0 ez badago (maiuskula/minuskula
; berdin). aldatzen ditu R0-R7
; lookup: R0, R1 = izena -> R0 = zehaztapena (edo 0), izen labur leunak barne. aldatzen ditu R0-R7
lookup:
C lookupraw
IGTR0 R29 lookup.pos
SUBR0 R30 R0
lookup.pos:
RET

; reserved: R0, R1 = izena -> R0 = zehaztapena 0.4.4-ko izen edo ezizen bat bada (izen labur leunak ez dira
; erreserbatzen: asm.rs-eko isa::reserved bezala), bestela 0. aldatzen ditu R0-R7
reserved:
C lookupraw
IGTR0 R29 reserved.done
SETR0 0
reserved.done:
RET

; lookupraw: lookup bezala, baina izen labur leunen zehaztapena negatiboan
lookupraw:
PUSHR8
RCR8 R1
SETR2 42
LDR2 R2
C copyup
SETR0 10
LDR0 R0
SETR1 42
LDR1 R1
RCR2 R8
SETR3 2047
C htfind
RCR0 R1
IEQR0 R30 lookupraw.done
ADDR0 R0 R31
ADDR0 R0 R31
LDR0 R0
lookupraw.done:
POPR8
RET

; builders: buildtext irakurri eta zehaztapen bakoitzari eraikitzailea eman; agindu bizi bakoitzak bat behar du
builders:
PUSHR8
PUSHR9
PUSHR10
C buildtext
RCR8 R0
builders.next:
LDR0 R8
INER0 R30 builders.byte
; erregistroen artean 0 bat; bi jarraian amaiera dira
ADDR8 R8 R31
LDR0 R8
IEQR0 R30 builders.check
J builders.next
builders.byte:
SETR1 32
INER0 R1 builders.word
ADDR8 R8 R31
J builders.next
builders.word:
; izena
RCR9 R8
builders.scan:
LDR0 R8
SETR1 32
IEQR0 R1 builders.name
ADDR8 R8 R31
J builders.scan
builders.name:
RCR0 R9
SUBR1 R8 R9
C lookup
IEQR0 R30 builders.unknown
RCR10 R0
ADDR8 R8 R31
C buildnum
SETR1 14
ADDR1 R10 R1
STR0 R1
C buildnum
SETR1 15
ADDR1 R10 R1
STR0 R1
J builders.next
builders.unknown:
STREAM 2
PRINT "tools/asm.qoa: buildtext names an instruction that is not in the table: "
RCR0 R9
SUBR1 R8 R9
C printbytes
PLN ""
EXIT 70
builders.check:
; agindu bizi guztiek eraikitzailea dute
SETR0 9
LDR9 R0
SETR0 8
LDR8 R0
builders.each:
IEQR9 R30 builders.done
SETR0 5
ADDR0 R8 R0
LDR0 R0
IEQR0 R31 builders.skip
SETR0 14
ADDR0 R8 R0
LDR0 R0
INER0 R30 builders.skip
STREAM 2
PRINT "tools/asm.qoa: buildtext has no builder for "
LDR0 R8
ADDR1 R8 R31
LDR1 R1
C printbytes
PLN ""
EXIT 70
builders.skip:
SETR0 24
ADDR8 R8 R0
SUBR9 R9 R31
J builders.each
builders.done:
POPR10
POPR9
POPR8
RET

; buildnum: R8 = kurtsorea -> R0 = hurrengo zenbaki hamartarra (hutsuneak saltatuta), R8 haren ondoren
buildnum:
LDR0 R8
SETR1 32
INER0 R1 buildnum.start
ADDR8 R8 R31
J buildnum
buildnum.start:
SETR2 0
buildnum.next:
LDR0 R8
SETR1 48
ILTR0 R1 buildnum.done
SETR1 57
IGTR0 R1 buildnum.done
SETR1 48
SUBR0 R0 R1
SETR1 10
MULR2 R2 R1
ADDR2 R2 R0
ADDR8 R8 R31
J buildnum.next
buildnum.done:
RCR0 R2
RET

; printbytes: R0 = helbidea, R1 = luzera -> byteak uneko irteerara. aldatzen ditu R0-R2
printbytes:
ADDR1 R0 R1
printbytes.next:
IEQR0 R1 printbytes.done
LDR2 R0
PUTCR2
ADDR0 R0 R31
J printbytes.next
printbytes.done:
RET

; printtext: R0 = kode-puntuen helbidea, R1 = kopurua -> uneko irteerara (utf-8). aldatzen ditu R0-R2
printtext:
ADDR1 R0 R1
printtext.next:
IEQR0 R1 printtext.done
LDR2 R0
COR2
ADDR0 R0 R31
J printtext.next
printtext.done:
RET

; ---------------------------------------------------------------- unicode-ko letrak
; adierazpenetako izenak rust-ek bezala: letra batekin edo _-rekin hasten dira (char::is_alphabetic) eta letrak,
; zenbakiak edo _ jarraitzen dute (char::is_alphanumeric). ascii ez direnetarako taulak rust-etik sortuak dira,
; lehen aldiz behar direnean irakurtzen dira

; alphatext / alnumtext: tarteak hamaseitarrez ("a-b"), 0-z amaitutako erregistroetan; hutsak amaitzen du
alphatext:
SETR0 0
LDR1 R0
RCR2 R1
; @alpha-begin
STXR1 "aa-aa b5-b5 ba-ba c0-d6 d8-f6 f8-2c1 2c6-2d1 2e0-2e4 2ec-2ec 2ee-2ee 345-345 363-374"
STXR1 "376-377 37a-37d 37f-37f 386-386 388-38a 38c-38c 38e-3a1 3a3-3f5 3f7-481 48a-52f 531-556 559-559"
STXR1 "560-588 5b0-5bd 5bf-5bf 5c1-5c2 5c4-5c5 5c7-5c7 5d0-5ea 5ef-5f2 610-61a 620-657 659-65f 66e-6d3"
STXR1 "6d5-6dc 6e1-6e8 6ed-6ef 6fa-6fc 6ff-6ff 710-73f 74d-7b1 7ca-7ea 7f4-7f5 7fa-7fa 800-817 81a-82c"
STXR1 "840-858 860-86a 870-887 889-88f 897-897 8a0-8c9 8d4-8df 8e3-8e9 8f0-93b 93d-94c 94e-950 955-963"
STXR1 "971-983 985-98c 98f-990 993-9a8 9aa-9b0 9b2-9b2 9b6-9b9 9bd-9c4 9c7-9c8 9cb-9cc 9ce-9ce 9d7-9d7"
STXR1 "9dc-9dd 9df-9e3 9f0-9f1 9fc-9fc a01-a03 a05-a0a a0f-a10 a13-a28 a2a-a30 a32-a33 a35-a36 a38-a39"
STXR1 "a3e-a42 a47-a48 a4b-a4c a51-a51 a59-a5c a5e-a5e a70-a75 a81-a83 a85-a8d a8f-a91 a93-aa8 aaa-ab0"
STXR1 "ab2-ab3 ab5-ab9 abd-ac5 ac7-ac9 acb-acc ad0-ad0 ae0-ae3 af9-afc b01-b03 b05-b0c b0f-b10 b13-b28"
STXR1 "b2a-b30 b32-b33 b35-b39 b3d-b44 b47-b48 b4b-b4c b56-b57 b5c-b5d b5f-b63 b71-b71 b82-b83 b85-b8a"
