LDR0 R8
C digitval
ILTR0 R30 uniranges.put
SETR1 16
MULR2 R2 R1
ADDR2 R2 R0
ADDR8 R8 R31
J uniranges.hex
uniranges.put:
STR2 R11
ADDR11 R11 R31
J uniranges.next
uniranges.done:
RCR0 R10
RCR1 R9
POPR11
POPR10
POPR9
POPR8
RET

